flowchart LR
    Browser[Browser]
    ALB[ALB + WAF]
    Session[Server/BFF Session\nHttpOnly Secure Cookie]
    Rate[Rate Limit\nIP + Principal + Customer + Action]
    Validate[Server Validation\nCanonicalization]
    Authz[Authorization + Ownership\nActor / Tenant / Resource / Action]
    Logic[Business Logic / State Machine\nPolicy Floors + Revision Checks]
    DBTX[PostgreSQL Transaction]
    RLS[RLS Defense in Depth]
    Data[(Tenant-scoped Data)]
    Audit[(Admin Audit)]
    Outbox[(Transactional Outbox)]
    SQS[(SQS)]
    Error[Safe Error Mapper\nStable code + correlation ID]

    Browser -->|HTTPS; no bearer auth in URL/storage| ALB
    ALB --> Session --> Rate --> Validate --> Authz --> Logic --> DBTX
    DBTX --> RLS --> Data
    DBTX --> Audit
    DBTX --> Outbox --> SQS

    Rate -. reject .-> Error
    Validate -. reject .-> Error
    Authz -. deny .-> Error
    Logic -. invalid state .-> Error
    DBTX -. failure .-> Error
    Error --> Browser
